{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out a short part of the game and paddle through cool waters by yourself or with a friend. Compared to the full game there's less playtime, limited map with less obstacles, no access to boss fights and customization, limited player count and boat types...<br><br>More about the full game:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PADDLE WITH FRIENDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Teamwork is the key</strong> as you and your friends share the same boat, navigating waters filled with unpredictable and hilarious chaos. You have to coordinate your paddles or you'll end up failing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/f82017f99d51036bc2d787140f5064e5.poster.avif?t=1759696031\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/f82017f99d51036bc2d787140f5064e5.webm?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/f82017f99d51036bc2d787140f5064e5.mp4?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE NEW ISLANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover islands with new biomes as you drive through dangerous paths. Each new biome offers a unique experience, and reaching the next island will always be more challenging!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/1e6845ad9c54b029f52458ab0598c7cd.poster.avif?t=1759696031\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/1e6845ad9c54b029f52458ab0598c7cd.webm?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/1e6845ad9c54b029f52458ab0598c7cd.mp4?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FUN WATER PHYSICS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paddling and water physics will challenge you, but that\u2019s not all. Be ready to face new obstacles and bosses along the way. You\u2019ll have to overcome them if you want to reach the treasure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/3ef406faf56aea80daea129e7bdf1c11.poster.avif?t=1759696031\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/3ef406faf56aea80daea129e7bdf1c11.webm?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/3ef406faf56aea80daea129e7bdf1c11.mp4?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFERENT BOAT TYPES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are several boats: single and two player kayaks, a four player boat and a  jet ski. Larger boats are harder to control, so you\u2019ll need your friends. But don\u2019t worry if you\u2019re playing solo, we\u2019ve designed a solo kayak and jet ski for you. You can play the game no matter what!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/2a273a7fff08a637277167b41d31612c.poster.avif?t=1759696031\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/2a273a7fff08a637277167b41d31612c.webm?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/2a273a7fff08a637277167b41d31612c.mp4?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE YOUR SKIN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boat Together offers a variety of skins for both your boat and character. With your own unique combinations, you can become the coolest treasure hunter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/5321a1aefe9f23ecd8a82c5ba6c13427.poster.avif?t=1759696031\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/5321a1aefe9f23ecd8a82c5ba6c13427.webm?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/extras/5321a1aefe9f23ecd8a82c5ba6c13427.mp4?t=1759696031\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076310?t=1759696031","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076310?t=1759696031","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/70e030385a39ea08aaaca89dafb63dfefd4639e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759696031","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076310/70e030385a39ea08aaaca89dafb63dfefd4639e7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759696031","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],